window.products.push({"id":522054,"name":"6 x 5 oz Easter Bread parchment baking paper Molds 'Zhostovo'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dqIfoOlOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"6 pcs. 5 oz Easter Bread parchment baking paper Molds Elegant paper bakeware from Ukraine in Zhostovo pattern. Shipped from Pikesville, MD. Fine food-grade free-standing disposable paper baking pans are good for Easter bread, Panettone, Cake, Brioche, Kulich, cupcakes, jumbo muffins, bread baking and any variety of projects in between. Perfect for home-baked gifts and commercial bakeries. Our molds eliminate the need for metal baking pans, cutting down on costly and time consuming cleanup, and allowing you to bake as many or as few items as you like. Made of food-safe rigid baking paper, these molds are oven safe up to 390 degrees Fahrenheit (200 degrees Celsius), freezer safe and microwave safe. Note the molds are not recommended for liquid use, as the manufacturing process leaves a number of pinprick holes on the bottom of the cup that liquid may seep through. Use these molds for a thicker substance like dough or batter. They are perfect for presenting your cakes to friends or for holding your cakes ready on the table for your guests to enjoy. Materials: sides - calendared paper with micro-perforation, bottom - micro-flute corrugated paper, with micro-p erforation. Size: 3\" x 3-1/2\" (70 x 85 mm) diameter x height. Baking weight: 5 oz (150 g).Set of 6 pcs. with different design (see photos).Disposable bakeware is recyclable but not compostable. Make sure to scroll over to view ALL photos. Please see and use all pictures for the very best description, and thanks for looking!Please note that current listing shows stock photos, actual color and shape may vary slightly. Made in Ukraine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dqIfoOlOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodya","source_asin":"B0863PMW9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0863PMW9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0863PMW9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
