window.products.push({"id":522059,"name":"Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer and Plastic Wrap Dispenser, OFFSIR 5 Separate Food Bags Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Bamboo Bag Holder with Cutter for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rGnROLAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️【Neat and Clean】: Dozens of the ziplok bags and plastic wrap will always cause the drawer to get stuck. The bags holder is designed for kitchen storage, clutter no longer exists, to bring your kitchen life a more convenient experience. ❤️【100% Natural Bamboo】: Our Ziplock Bag Organizer and Wrap Dispenser combination is made of sustainable environment friendly natural bamboo. we use thickened bamboo board which go through dozens of anti falling tests. The label is made of laser engraved letters, highly accurate, clear and beautiful, helping you to classify the food bags. ❤️【All in 1 Bag Organizer】: ① This sets contains 3 in 1 foil and wrap dispenser with cutter, perfect for Aluminum foil, saran wrap, plastic wrap, cling wrap, wax paper. ② The ziploc bag organizer slots are designed in larger size.4 slots zip lock bag container or organizer Compatible with Ziploc, Bulky, Happy, Solimo. Suitable for gallons, quarts, sandwiches and snacks. ❤️【Applicable Scenario】: According to your needs, decide to use them alone or in combination. You can choose to put it on the table, in the drawer and it will easily adapt to your drawers, pantry, kitchen cabinet and countertop space. ❤️【Easy to use】: No assembly required and no complicated accessories. Just put the ziplock bag into the bamboo storage box according to the label display and pull each bag from the top as you do with tissue boxes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rGnROLAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFFSIR","source_asin":"B0B4NLVK67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4NLVK67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4NLVK67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
