window.products.push({"id":522110,"name":"Hypnotic Gems 1 lb Bulk Rainbow Fluorite Rough from China - Natural Raw Stones & Fountain Rocks for Tumbling, Cabbing, Polishing, Wire Wrapping, Wicca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c6-1fkSVL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This spectacular Rainbow Fluorite rough comes directly from the Rainbow Fluorite mine in China. Once it arrives at our warehouse in the USA this beautiful Rainbow Fluorite is checked for quality to ensure only material that meets Polones e Brilho's quality standards is sent with every order. The sizes of the Rainbow Fluorite you receive will average around 0.75\" to 1.25\" for most of the stones making this material perfect for tumbling, polishing, wire wrapping, crafts, fountain rocks, and any other application limited only by your imagination.You are ordering 1 full pound of this rough Rainbow Fluorite which contains a variety of piece sizes and since it is sold by total weight the exact number of pieces you receive may vary from one bag to the next. It is likely that the pieces you receive will have cut edges which is done to keep the pieces within our normal size ranges. It is also possible that some pieces are going to have a thin layer of dust on them and we recommend rinsing off the stones once they are received. Our pictures were taken with the stones having been rinsed and they were taken while the stones were still wet. The colors and patterns you receive are random in each bag and you may find greens, purples and other colors in the stones you receive. The stones you are ordering is the PeB Brand with the manufacturer's part number of PEB-RF-1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c6-1fkSVL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B015SCO9LA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015SCO9LA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015SCO9LA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
