window.products.push({"id":522117,"name":"SAHEYER Cervical Memory Foam Pillow,Ergonomic Contour Pillows for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief Orthopedic Neck Pillow for Side,Back and Stomach Sleep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3ka73GhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose SAHEYER:We can only make pillows and pursue the ultimate. Strictly control product quality problems. If you often have poor sleep quality due to shoulder, head,spine, or neck pain, the SAHEYER cervical memory foam pillow will be your best choice. It fits the neck perfectly, relaxes the head naturally, and aligns the shoulders and back. Let you maintain the correct sleeping posture, and get rid of the nightmare of the night.Features：Q: What is the dimension of this pillow?A: 23.7 x 13.8 x 5.1/4.3 inches (please compare the height of the pillow you usually use before buying to confirm that the height is suitable for you)Q: Why do people say that memory foam pillows are hard?A: Because memory foam is an odorless and slow-rebound material that supports the cervical spine. The degree of softness and hardness depends on the degree of adaptation of the user, most people are used to ordinary pillows.Q: Which way can I get the best sleep experience？A: It depends on your usual sleep habits.For side sleepers: You can place your arm on the arm support area, which will form approximately 45°.For back sleepers: Choose a height that best suits you and fits your cervical spine perfectly. Let your head enjoy the sinking feeling and immerse yourself in your sleep.For stomach sleepers: Put your shoulders on the pillow first, and your face fits our silky pillowcase to experience the ultimate relaxation.Q: What should I do if I feel uncomfortable using this neck pillow for the first time?A: Because you've never used an ergonomic pillow, it's normal for your body to feel uncomfortable when adjusted to the correct position. We recommend you try it for a few more nights, we offer a 100-day trial.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3ka73GhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAHEYER","source_asin":"B09W2QJKXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W2QJKXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W2QJKXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
