window.products.push({"id":522152,"name":"DanMark Christmas Ornament 2021,Christmas Tree Decorations 2021 Ornaments,Christmas Round Pendant Decoration,Cute Funny Wood Plywood Christmas Ornamen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X3MZbqh8L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Looking for a fun way to decorate a friend or family member’s tree? If you are tired of the same old boring Christmas ornaments and want to give something that will get a real laugh for this year’s holiday party, then you came to the right listing. The pandemic has turned 2021 into a year to remember. We wore face masks, we got to know our families a lot better, toilet paper was difficult to find in stores. People stockpiled it and fought in stores over it ! Gifting this toilet paper ornament is the way to brighten up someone’s branches! The perfect reminder of what 2021 was about. 2021 will be a year to remember for decades! Celebrate the year no one could have predicted with this Christmas ornament. It perfectly captures the crazy year we've had as toilet paper had never made headlines like it did during this pandemic. Sometimes the best gifts are gifts that make everyone laugh. Don't let these amazing ornament pass you and get yourself this decoration that will be an added laugh at Christmas on the tree and for years to come! Product details : - Dimension : 3.1 inch in diameter - Material : Wooden","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X3MZbqh8L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DanMark","source_asin":"B09MKY9293","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MKY9293","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MKY9293","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
