window.products.push({"id":522180,"name":"La Pastiche OverstockArt The Piazza San Marco Venice, 1881 by Pierre-Auguste Renoir Hand Painted Oil on Canvas with Opulent Frame, 33\" x 29\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":593.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sbuo9XtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Renoir's The Piazza San Marco Venice captures the true essence of Impressionistic style where the overall perception of the subject is more important than the realistic value. Renoir's splendid painting is a tribute to the Master's unique ability to translate life onto canvas. Enjoy the beauty of this piece of art in any room of the home. It is sure to hold the attention of those who gaze upon it. Born to a working class family, Pierre-Auguste Renoir began his artistic apprenticeship painting porcelain at age 13. While he would visit the Louvre to study the French masters during his early years, his formal training began with Swiss artist Charles Gleyre.Unlike many of his fellow Impressionists, the official Salon in Paris occasionally accepted his work for exhibition, beginning in 1864 and continuing through 1870, and once again in 1879. During the period in between, he helped to organize the first Impressionist exhibition in 1874, which was a home for those artists rejected by the Salon. It included the paintings of fellow luminaries such as Degas, Cezanne, Pissarro and Renoir's friend and frequent collaborator, Monet. Frame Description: Opulent Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sbuo9XtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"overstockArt","source_asin":"B07T5F5TXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T5F5TXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T5F5TXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522181,"name":"Taste of Home® 2-Piece Non-Stick Metal Baking Sheet Set 15x10 and 17x11","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812wH++1I4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bake your family favorites using the Taste of Home 2-Piece Non-Stick Metal Baking Sheet Set. This durable bakeware is designed for everyday use and is an ideal choice for the home chef. You'll enjoy baking a variety of foods on this baking sheet set from tasty desserts to savory sheet pan dinners. Our bakeware features an embossed geometric design that strengthens the baking sheet while increasing the air-flow to food, creating evenly distributed heat for consistent baking every time. This beautiful geometric pattern is carried throughout most of the Taste of Home product lines, adding style and function to the tools in your kitchen. The Ash Gray color of the bakeware is complementary to modern kitchens. The premium non-stick coating allows for effortless release of foods and will enable you to prepare healthier treats with minimal to no prep to bakeware before baking process, leaving you to feel good about the food you're serving. The easy-to-grip handles make these baking sheets easy to transfer in and out of the oven. When it's time to clean up, simply place your bakeware in the dishwasher for easy cleaning. With two baking sheets, you can bake to feed a crowd or bake both dinner and dessert for your family at the same time; the possibilities are endless. All Taste of Home products are designed in partnership with and rigorously tested by the Taste of Home test kitchen and are Test Kitchen-approved. Make sure to snag your Taste of Home 2-Piece Non-Stick Metal Baking Sheet Set today. Manufactured and distributed under license from RDA Enthusiast Brands, LLC by Range Kleen Mfg., Inc. TASTE OF HOME marks and logos are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of RDA Enthusiast Brands, LLC. Copyright 2019 All rights reserved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812wH++1I4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Range Kleen","source_asin":"B07V1J73H6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V1J73H6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V1J73H6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
