window.products.push({"id":522220,"name":"Sunshine Half Moon rug, Boho Nursery rug, Sunset Bedroom Rug, Colorful Semi Circle Bath mat, Fun Cute mat for Kid's Room and Classroom Slip Resistant ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Tay9rIHCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some style for little budget Is your home lacking those little pieces that add warmth and style? Do you watch home reno shows and wish you had their eye for staging? You can add a beautiful finishing touch to your bathroom, front door, bedroom, nursery or any room in-fact, with our slip resistant half circle bathroom rug. The shade of yellow used marries perfectly with soft neutral tones, but it can also be used to add a clash of colour to blues, pinks or even grays. Adding style pieces to your apartment, student accommodation, condo or house is affordable and what’s more, it has a practical use too! Multi-use rug Prevent slips in the kitchen, sore feet at the sink, warmth underfoot in the laundry room or a fun splash of color to your child’s room. There are endless opportunities of using our half circle rug, it’s not just for bathrooms. Use it on a porch, in a pool house, on the decking, to the door to the basement. It is an indoor rug so bear that in mind when choosing your spot. If you can’t decide on just one place to use it then why not buy more? BUY NOW and add some colorful boho décor vibes to your home without breaking the budget. This boho bath mat has a soft, comforting, medium pile that feels delightful next to bare feet. Note the slip resistant latex backing that holds the mat in place while protecting your floor. This comes in popular Honey Mustard color that goes with all styles, periods, and color choices. Get this vintage, retro, Boho bathroom rug compactly sized at 36\" by 20\". Ideal for bedroom, dorm, nursery, kitchen, and all your bathrooms. Product Features - Sunset Half Circle Bohemian Bathroom Rug, Machine Washable GENTLY CYCLE ONLY, Slip resistant backing, lovely Honey Mustard color goes with everything, Get Yours - While we have a fresh batch in stock ready to ship direct to your door. Many customers love the look in person so much they return to buy another. It makes a much appreciated gift for friends, family, and co-workers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Tay9rIHCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIEN BEAU","source_asin":"B0BLCV89S3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCV89S3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCV89S3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
