window.products.push({"id":522270,"name":"Reel Art Indy Holy Grail Chalice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YwNGG2-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a Replica of the famous Holy Grail as it was seen in the hit film \"Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade\" (1989) Starring: Harrison Ford and Sean Connery. The Indy Grail appears like a pottery type goblet with Gold over it just as the real prop did in the film. It is very detailed and great efforts were made to make the artwork and paint job appear just as the original that was in the movie. This Holy Grail is ready to give you the everlasting gift of life! The Grail is made out of a poly resin material, very durable and weighs 3 pounds. The Indy Grail measures; 6 inches (centimeters) tall by 4.5 inches (centimeters) in diameter at the upper drinking cup lip. Grail does not come with the Circular or Lighted Jungle Plaques, and Display Case as shown. They are available in another selection. The Circular one can be used for Grail, Sankara stones, Idol and various ancint mystery items. The Lighted one can be used also for same. Idol will not fit on it. However it has a light that shines through center to light up your Amber Sankara stone or place your Antidote Vial on it and it will light it up also. Very cool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YwNGG2-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reel Art","source_asin":"B003PNLFH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003PNLFH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003PNLFH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
