window.products.push({"id":522380,"name":"Smart Design Silicone Pan & Plate Protector - Medium - Foldable Design - for Bakeware, Cookware, Pots, & Pans - Protects Against Scratches & Cracks (2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDVV+pcPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart Design Pan and Plate Protector Silicone pan and plate protectors are durable and stylish in your kitchen. The silicone design allows it to fit into most pots, pans, dishware and more allowing for them to be stacked without causing nicks, scratches or chips and freeing up valuable storage space in cabinets and drawers. Package Includes Smart Design 2 Pack Silicone Pan and Plate Protector For saving space in cabinets by stacking or nesting bakeware, pots, and pans safely. Features and Benefits Includes single pan and plate protector for cookware that folds and forms around pots and pans. Extends the life of your non-stick cookware by preventing scratches when being stored and can be used as a trivet. Product Specifications Dimensions: Medium 14 x 14 inches (L x W) Package: 2 Pack Color: Red Material: Silicone Design: Star Shape Brand and Warranty Info People around the world live smarter with Smart Design, manufacturers of innovative, high-quality home and commercial organizational and laundry care products. Since 1970, Smart Design has set the standard of excellence in the Home Organization Industry by developing products that allow consumers to optimize their needs. Everything from your closet, kitchen, laundry room, home office, garage and auto to your workplace.  Located in Southern California, Smart Design is a family-owned company with customer service at the core of our business. If you have any questions, issues, or concerns about your order, reach out to our Customer Service Team via email anytime, 24/7. Our Team will do their best to respond to all emails within 24 hours. Visit us online for phone support Monday-Friday 8 am – 5 pm PST.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDVV+pcPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Design","source_asin":"B01DO3G2Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DO3G2Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DO3G2Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522381,"name":"Balcony by Lois Bryan, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":113.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aS0cfSvDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features balconies. Lois Bryan describes herself as a 10-year old little kid, cleverly disguised as a 'woman of a certain age'..ordinary, garden-variety, happily married photography Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aS0cfSvDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKH5430","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKH5430","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKH5430","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
