window.products.push({"id":522479,"name":"The Lone Cypress by Dave MacVicar Frame, 16 by 16\", White Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RpzEnB1-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a black and white photograph of a cypress tree on a mountain. Dave MacVicar is a Canadian photography who resides in Toronto, Canada. Dave's passion for photography was discovered when he purchased an entry level camera to capture video footage of his band. Soon after he began photographing anything and everything in his hometown. He began focusing on landscape as his primary focus. Dave's fascination with symmetry began to impact the evolution of his work. His traditional photographs were replaced by long exposure black and white images that covey a tranquil yet somewhat brooding feel. Dave is also been focusing on abstract architecture photographs in addition to his landscape and seascape work. An 11x11 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x16 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RpzEnB1-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0BNJML3XM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNJML3XM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNJML3XM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
