window.products.push({"id":522654,"name":"MAISON ARTS 47\" Fireplace TV Stand with Electric Fireplace Inserts Farmhouse Barn Door Media Console Table Entertainment Center for TVs Up to 55\" for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BnBI+Ty-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stay Warm with Fireplace TV Stand】Turn on the fireplace built into this TV stand and enjoy your winter night. Simple plug-in 18\" electric fireplace has a 4,780 BTU rating and can heat a room up to 400 sq. Only the heating element and its containing area get hot when in use, keeping the safety of your kids and pets. Electric fires are suitable to be placed under a TV as they are 100% energy efficient and the heat comes from the front or the bottom of the fire so your TV will be safe. 【Large Storage Cabinet & TV Stand】: Dimension - 47\"L x 15\"W x 32\"H. This storage cabinet with shelves providing plenty of storage space for your electronics, decor, messy toys, snacks, books, magazines or towels with flexibility easy access sliding doors, so as to make your space clean and tidy. As a TV stand it fits up to a 60-inch TV, quite suitable for living room and bedroom as a storage cabinet or TV stand. 【Sturdy & Water-Resistant Storage Cabinet】:Crafted from high-grade manufactured wood and solid wood frame for long-lasting construction, the Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet hold up to 200 lbs weight.The premium MDF with high-grade painting made the storage cabinet water-resistant and easy to care. 【2-IN-1 DESIGN】: Combination of TV Stand and electric fireplace. The first way is to use the shelf to put in the middle to make TV Stand have more storage space; The second way is to remove the middle shelf, and then put the fireplace in to bring warmth at the cold winter. Whether it’s to save space or to have a great looking and functional TV stand, then an fireplace TV stand is an essential buy. 【Easy to Assemble & Service Guarantee】: Please note the tv stand and fireplace insert will be delivered separately with 2 packages, which may arrive at different days. Detailed instruction and all mounting hardware are included in the packages. Two adults are recommended for proper assembly, if you have any problem with our products, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BnBI+Ty-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAISON ARTS","source_asin":"B09LYJWDW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYJWDW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYJWDW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
