window.products.push({"id":522666,"name":"INSENVO Humidifiers for Bedroom, 2023 Upgraded Full Process Visualization Top Fill Cool Mist Humidifiers, 3L Quiet Ultrasonic Humidifier for Home Baby","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fhcomVyWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top Fill Humidifier & Full Transparent Visualization: Just add water directly on the top without moving even opening it, super convenient for the elderly, pregnant women, and children. In addition, our humidifier for kids is made of transparent ABS environmental grade material both the box and the inner tube of the atomization area, you can completely see the whole humidifier in the work of the atomization process or the water level, giving you and the children a fun learning environment. 2023 Latest PCBA Overhead & Easy to Get Thoroughly Cleaned: Different from the traditional humidifiers, we pioneered the PCBA main control board overhead and placed the atomization chamber in the water tank, thus the water will not overflow to the main board to solve the disadvantages of seepage or short circuit. Our inner bucket is removable and with a cleaning brush, so you can quickly put your hands scrubbed into all corners to wholly clean the tank, keeping it free of mold or bacteria. 28dB Quiet humidifiers & Night Light: Adopted a sound-deadening technology, INSENVO air humidifier provides you a stable comfortable humidity level with 28dB silent running, as quiet as a mom's light whispering. Furthermore, with an optional a unique blue night light, our humidifiers creat a soft and ambient atmosphere for your kids and give a best sleeping companion for light sleepers, kids and your cared families. 3 Mist Level Setting & Timer & Auto Shut Off: INSENVO ultrasonic cool mist humidifier comes with THREE adjustable mist level modes: H-high(200ml/h) or M-middle continuous(150ml/h)& L-intermittent(100ml/h) to provide your house a wonderful humidity choice between 45%RH to 65%RH. With an energy-efficient time-off setting function of 2H/4H/8H, our room humidifier can keep air fresh for continuing working for up to 30 hrs. Besides, this portable humidifier will auto-turn off if it runs out of water. Exclusive Design Patent & Full Certification & Friendly Customer Service: INSENVO is a global factory specializing in the development, research, design, and sales of humidifiers. We are committed to solving the humidifier's pain points and developing this newly designed humidifier with global patents and RoHS/FCC/ CE/PSE certification. We are eager to provide our customers with better products and more perfect service with 6 months free return service and lifetime warranty service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fhcomVyWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSENVO","source_asin":"B0BRC8B18G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRC8B18G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRC8B18G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
