window.products.push({"id":522766,"name":"50pcs Stainless Steel Heavy Duty Clip with Hook for Curtain, Photos, String Lights, Home Decoration Outdoor Party Wire Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bF4MdzN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SATIN NICKEL CLIPS VALUABLE PACK] – High quality 304 stainless steel, Stronger tension clip support heavier application. The packages comes 50pcs hook clips, each clip size 3.3x1cm (1.3 x 0.4 inch), they can also be linked together for desired length. [MULTI-PURPOSE CLIP SET] – String hanger clips can be used for kids art projects, hanging curtains, and displaying photographs; the creative possibilities are endless. Metal teeth opening makes using clips easy and holds a tight grip. [DURABLE & PRACTICAL] – Heavy duty curtain clips can be hooked together to extend the length, More durable than wooden clothespins that can break easily, these metal clothespins will stand up as clothes hangers time after time. [VALUED PACK 60pcs HANGING CLIPS] – Metal hook clips comes 50pcs. A versatile hanger clip clamp made of nickel for quality and long lasting strength. They can also be linked together for desired length. [WIDE APPLICATION] – Plenty of practical uses from clinics, hospitals, schools, offices and home use. Perfect for hanging photos, drapes, and many other home uses! Where ever you need privacy these are ready to use!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bF4MdzN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINOWU","source_asin":"B07VY2PX5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VY2PX5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VY2PX5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
