window.products.push({"id":522842,"name":"CADMIC Pipe Floating Shelves with Wood 3 Tier Pipe Shelf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oz18Rh0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【RETRO INDUSTRIAL STYLE DESIGN】This water pipe shelves design is inspired by steampunk. The retro industrial water pipe style gives the shelve a unique decorative beauty, allowing the wall shelving to be placed in many places, such as living rooms, bedrooms, farmhouses, bars, coffee shops ( Displayed as a cup holder on the wall), any other place you want to install. 【SPACE-SAVING DESIGN】This wall-mounted industrial pipe shelf adopts an open storage space design, which is convenient for daily storage and access while saving your floor space and adding extra space to your house. The tube rack can be used to \"DIY\" your bookshelves, kitchen racks, bathroom racks, and flower racks to create your own home life. 【STABLE & DURABLE】The wall-mounted bookshelf is composed of solid cast iron water pipes to ensure that the bookshelf can be used for a long time. You don’t need to worry about it collapsing, breaking or bending down. At the same time, the surface of the water pipe adopts an integrated spraying process, and the paint that is not easy to fall off prevents the generation of powder and debris and is easy to clean. 【OPEN STORAGE DESIGN FOR CONVENIENT FETCH 】This industrial bathroom pipe shelves,which is designed with open storage space, ensures you can take things straightly without hurting hands. It can be used as a kitchen rack to place oil and salt sauce cans, as a bookshelf in the living room or in the bathroom for display make up things or changing clothes. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE]】The pipe rack has a simple structure, and the package contains iron pipes, flanges, wood and screws, and is accompanied by schematic diagrams and instructions for use. Using an electric drill, follow the installation steps, you will find installing the shelves is a breeze. At that time you will enjoy the sense of accomplishment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oz18Rh0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CADMIC","source_asin":"B09R1TYGYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R1TYGYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R1TYGYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522843,"name":"iSi K8678 10-Inch Silicone Basting Brush, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AT2SM90VL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Say goodbye to conventional basting brushes that never quite come clean. With the unique ORKA design, space-age styling and high-tech materials combine to create a professional-quality kitchen tool whose bristles will never melt, shed, fray or stain. Made from heavy-duty silicone and brushed stainless steel, it resists heat to a remarkable 600 degrees Fahrenheit--more than 375 degrees above boiling water. The nonporous nature of silicone means it cleans up beautifully under running water, in the washing machine, or even in the dishwasher alongside pots and pans. Soft bristle edges keep this 10-inch brush from damaging cookware--even fragile nonstick finishes--while a hole at one end of the handle facilitates hanging for storage. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AT2SM90VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iSi North America","source_asin":"B0002JA1YO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002JA1YO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002JA1YO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
