window.products.push({"id":522943,"name":"K&N Horse Pony Foal Table Desk Alarm Clock Night Light h0163","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M3kWsFfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"(1) Condition: New (2) Size of the alarm clock: 3.2 x 3.4 x 1.5 (L*W*D) inches. (3) Color of the alarm clock: Gray. (4) Push-button backlight for nighttime viewing. (5) This alarm clock still has 3 buttons back of it, one button for time a","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M3kWsFfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"K&N","source_asin":"B01MZIT1E6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZIT1E6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZIT1E6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522944,"name":"Hyoola Candles Liquid Paraffin Lamp Oil - Blue Smokeless, Odorless, Ultra Clean Burning Fuel for Indoor and Outdoor Use - Highest Purity Available - 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GJ27kyYbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A PREMIUM PRODUCT FOR SAFER FLAMES This Paraffin Lamp Oil by Hyoola Candles is processed, refined and distilled more than traditional kerosene to produce a light source suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. Able to be used with any Lamp Oil wick (Cotton or Fiberglass) , this oil fuels a smokeless, odorless flame. Now you can kindle your lights, light your lanterns and more without the soot or strong, unpleasant odor of kerosene. VERSATILE USE While gentle for indoor and home use, Hyoola Candles’s Paraffin Lamp Oil is also powerful for outdoor venues. Light your tiki torches with this oil for outdoor barbecues and pool parties. Create beautiful, glowing centerpieces for weddings and fancy events. Light the pathway to an outdoor wedding canopy with a series of flames fueled by this oil. Illuminate restaurant tables and buffet counters for a romantic touch. Keep a bottle of Hyoola Candles’s Paraffin Lamp Oil in store and be prepared for any power outage. Allowing you to light oil lamps and lanterns. LIGHT UP IN STYLE Hyoola Candles’s Paraffin Lamp Oil comes in an assortment of six different colors so you can customize your glow to suit your taste. How to Achieve the Best Performance Don't Mix Different Fuels. Remove old residual fuel from the fuel reservoir before filling with Fuel. You certainly don't want to mix fuels together. Mixing fuels will change their burning properties and may cause excessive smoke. Use a Clean, Uncontaminated Lamp Oil Wick (cotton or Fiberglass). The wick is the delivery vehicle for the fuel. If the wick is contaminated with old fuel or water, it will not perform properly. Keep the Wick Height to a Minimum which Inhibits Smoking and Conserves Fuel. The wick should be as low as possible. This will reduce smoke, provide a more consistent flame and conserve fuel. IMPORTANT: Even the purest oil smokes if used improperly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GJ27kyYbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B0BRD9RM4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRD9RM4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRD9RM4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522945,"name":"Poloma Wall Mounted Towel Warmer Rack for Bathrooms, Electric Heated Towel Rack Heater, 12-Bars Stainless Steel Black.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rK7+rbCTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【FREELY TIMING MODES & LED DISPLAY】No need to set 1 or 2 hours anymore or guess whether it's on or off. The Paraheeter towel warmer has a built-in timer that ranges from 1-9 hours with visual LED indicators. Its modern design, functional, and undeniably sleek appearance go perfectly with any bathroom style or Spa and are convenient for your family. ✔【WARM & COZY】Equipped with a built-in Temp sensor( The adjustable temp ranges from 115℉-155℉ ). Once installed, you can simply plug it into an outlet and enjoy toasty textiles in as little as 5-8 minutes. The temperature sensor and the 1-9 hour timer modes enable you to keep your towels dry and warm for long periods to give you a warm and cozy experience on a chilly day. ✔【EASY INSTALLATION & SAFE】Ergonomic structural design, Comes with all the hardware needed, and complete instructions convenient for quick installation. Also, this unit is an excellent towels heating solution, featuring a waterproof rating of IPX4 so that it can be used safely in the bathroom. ✔【HARD-WIRED & PLUG-IN OPTIONS】Trying to keep your bathroom sleek appearance? You can route the power into a wall cavity to the nearest power source（be done by an electrician only!）. No time to wait for an electrician? No problem, all you need to do is mount and plug it into a 110v outlet, and that’s it. ✔【WARMING LIFESTYLE & ATTRACTIVE DESIGN】Majority let their bath towels air dry after use, then machine wash and dry them weekly. However, medically this isn’t advised, as bacteria can quickly breed on towels due to the moisture, warmth, and skin cells that reside on them. The longer towels take to dry, the more time bacteria have to grow. You could either wash towels frequently, which can be inconvenient, or add a heated towel rack to your bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rK7+rbCTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poloma","source_asin":"B0BX5W4BHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX5W4BHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX5W4BHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
