window.products.push({"id":522954,"name":"SEDETA White Computer Desk, 55\" Gaming Desk with Hutch, Keyboard Tray & LED Lights, Home Office Desks with Storage, Adjustable Shelves, Bookshelf, Mon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Juh6dAHTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Desk】Create a versatile workstation that’ll meet all your needs with this all-in-one office desk with hutch shelf, LED lights, monitor riser, keyboard tray, bookshelf and CPU stand. Use this computer monitor riser to easily raise your monitor to just the right height, reduction of back and neck strain and pain. It can also be adjusted upwards, the wide desktop plus hutch shelves offer ample room for work essentials. 【Cool & Smart Led Light Strips 】The SEDETA gaming desk comes with RGB LED light strip, remote control via APP, Over 60000 colors and 29 flashing modes for your to choose. Led light strip with music sync function, built-in sensitivity adjustable mic, led light color will change with the rhythm of the sound and music. And with timer function, just enjoy it in a smart way, create gaming and working atmosphere. Light Up Your Gaming with LED Light Strip. 【Large Working Space】 55\"(L)*21.6\"(W)*64.5\"(H) dimension can easily accommodate your laptop, books, files, desk accessories. The large workstation can hold 2 computers at the same time. Built-in stand shelf is the ideal place to set printer, multiple monitors, plants. The keyboard tray is ideal for 108-key or 87-key keyboard + mouse, which can free up more desktop space. Abundant storage space can meet all your needs ! 【Ample Storage Capacity】Got a list of books you wish you had time for? Stop piling them in a deep box to be forgotten, and put them on this 3 extra shelves and grab them with ease. There is more than enough room for small/medium accessories up top (lamp, plant, picture, controllers, etc.). Abundant storage space can meet all your needs! You won't regret purchasing this if you're trying to solve multiple space and posture/ergonomic problems! 【Easy to Maintain & Assemble & After-sales Service】 P2 degree Environmental solid particle wood with high resistance on scratch & friction. The desktop is waterproof and scratchproof. All of the hardware for assembly and instructions are included in the package. It's easy to put together with instructions. If your item arrives damaged, scratched or missing part, please feel free to contact us, we will send you free replacement or offer a partial refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Juh6dAHTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEDETA","source_asin":"B0C2YNYN6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2YNYN6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2YNYN6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522955,"name":"Winco C-F6, 6-Hour Wick-Type Chafing Fuel Can with Twist Cap for Chafing Dishes and Coffee Urns (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S1h480ohL._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep your dishes or beverages hot and ready for serving with this amazing 6 hours fuel can for chafing dishes and coffee urns. Indispensable item for catered events, buffet lines and outdoor parties, this non-flammable liquid diethylene glycol fuel provides safe flaming and helps to keep the can cool to the touch even during the use. Being one of the safest burning fuels on the market, this can features a twist cap top for an extra convenience and safety. Allow for approximately 6 hours of burn time.use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S1h480ohL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winco","source_asin":"B01I3EKQSU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I3EKQSU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I3EKQSU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":522956,"name":"Sea Aloha Surf Poncho Women - Towel Poncho - Hooded Towel Adult - Changing Poncho - Turkish Cotton Towel Poncho - Poncho Beach Towel - Surf, Beach, Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sI7+mTLXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you ever see surfers on the side on the road changing in and out of their wetsuits using nothing but a towel around their waist and wonder how you will do that as a lady? As a woman, it is extremely difficult and frustrating! So you decide to buy a surf poncho to make it easy to undress and change discreetly, only to find that all the designs and colors are catered to men! Sea Aloha was born out of necessity to create high quality, functional, comfortable, and aesthetically beautiful products for the female surfer. Our ponchos are made in Turkey with 100% Turkish cotton. They are comfortable and soft on your skin. Due to the extra-long flat-woven fibers of the cotton, not only does it feel softer over time, sand is less likely to stick to your poncho. It is thick enough to wear in winter and thin enough to be wearable in the summer. For your next vacation, it is easy to pack in a suitcase or throw it in your surfboard bag. The poncho is versatile and has many uses. It is machine washable and recommended to hang dry. Buy for yourself or as a gift. It’s like having your own portable changing room everywhere you go! Thank you for supporting a woman-owned US business!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sI7+mTLXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sea Aloha","source_asin":"B09RVJZXVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-522956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RVJZXVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RVJZXVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
